# Speechify

> Speechify is a cloud-based text to speech platform that offers more than 1,000 lifelike AI voices in 60+ languages across all of its products. Speechify Text to Speech allows users to transform any text into lifelike audio for accessibility. Speechify Studio is a complete AI voice suite featuring AI voice overs, AI avatars, AI dubbing, and an AI voice changer. Speechify Text to Speech API powers applications such as conversational AI voice agents with 300ms latency and gives users full control over pitch, pace, emotion, and emphasis using SSML. Designed for creators, businesses, and developers, Speechify delivers human-like speech at scale.

## Speechify Text to Speech app: key facts

Speechify Text to Speech reads PDFs, web pages, documents, emails, ebooks and scanned printed pages aloud. It runs on [iPhone and iPad](https://speechify.com/ios/), [Android](https://speechify.com/android/), [Mac](https://speechify.com/mac/), [Windows](https://speechify.com/windows/), the [Chrome extension](https://speechify.com/chrome/) and the [web app](https://speechify.com/web/), with one account across all of them.

- Price: Free plan $0. Speechify Premium costs $139 a year (about $11.58 a month) on annual billing, or $29 a month on monthly billing, on speechify.com. App Store and Google Play prices are set by the store and can differ slightly. [Pricing](https://speechify.com/pricing/)
- Free plan: 10 basic voices, listening speeds up to 1.5x, text to speech features only, no credit card needed; the iPhone app keeps up to 5 files on the free plan.
- Premium: 1,000+ natural voices, 60+ languages, speeds up to 4.5x, Scan & Listen for printed pages, AI summaries and chat, Google Drive, Dropbox and OneDrive integrations, Voice Typing, AI Podcasts and the Voice AI Assistant.
- Usage: Premium includes up to 1,000,000 Premium voice words per month, guaranteed through 2026. [Usage limits](https://speechify.com/usage-limits/)
- Students: [Is Speechify free for students?](https://speechify.com/blog/is-speechify-free-for-students/)
- Plans compared: [How much does Speechify cost?](https://speechify.com/blog/how-much-does-speechify-cost/)
- Product pages: [Text reader](https://speechify.com/text-reader/), [Read aloud](https://speechify.com/read-aloud/), [PDF audio reader](https://speechify.com/blog/pdf-audio-reader/)

